    <panel_attributes>title=SD05 - Find or Generate Recipe   (UC03; F03, F04, F06, F11, F12)\nThe page calls the facade in-process; the CLI (RecipesCommand find / generate) and the assistant call the same operations
obj=Meal Planner~U ACTOR
obj=:RecipesView\n«JavaFX page»~GUI
obj=:MealPlanningFacade~F
obj=:AgentController~AC
obj=:MealPlanningAgent~AG
obj=:ToolManager~TM
obj=:RecipeTool~RT
obj=:RecipeRepository~RR
obj=:PlanningStrategyFactory~SF
obj=strategy:\nPlanningStrategy~ST
obj=:PromptBuilder~PB
obj=:ProviderLLMAdapter\n«LLMClient»~LLM
obj=:IngredientRepository~IR
obj=:ConstraintValidator~CV

U-&gt;&gt;&gt;GUI : 1: "Quick high-protein\ndinner, max 20 min"
GUI-&gt;&gt;&gt;F : 2: recommendRecipe(profileId,\nrequest, filters, mode); on=F
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;AC : 3: recommendRecipe(request,\nfilters); on=AC
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;AC + : 4:\nbuildContext(\nrequest)
tick=1
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;AG : 5: recommendRecipes(\ncontext, filters); on=AG
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;LLM : 6: generateStructured(prompt, next_action schema, INSTRUCTIONS); on=LLM
LLM.&gt;AG : 7: call_tool: recipeSearch(args); off=LLM
text=AG:one step of the tool\nloop shown in SD01
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;TM : 8: isValidCall(toolName,\nargs); on=TM
TM.&gt;AG : 9: true; off=TM
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;TM : 10: execute(toolName, args, context); on=TM
TM-&gt;&gt;&gt;RT : 11: execute(args, context); on=RT
RT-&gt;&gt;&gt;RR : 12: search(query); on=RR
RR.&gt;RT : 13: curated and saved\nrecipes; off=RR
RT.&gt;TM : 14: ToolResult(recipes allowed\nfor the profile); off=RT
TM.&gt;AG : 15: ToolResult; off=TM
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;AG + : 16:\nrankRecipes(\ncandidates,\ncontext)
tick=1
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;SF : 17: strategyFor(context); on=SF
SF-&gt;&gt;&gt;ST : 18: configure(profile)
SF.&gt;AG : 19: strategy; off=SF
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;ST : 20: rank(candidates, context); on=ST
ST.&gt;AG : 21: ranked list; off=ST
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;PB : 22: buildRecommendationPrompt(context, filters, ranked, ...); on=PB
PB.&gt;AG : 23: prompt; off=PB
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;LLM : 24: generateStructured(prompt, recipe_recommendation schema, INSTRUCTIONS); on=LLM
LLM.&gt;AG : 25: chosen names and rationale; off=LLM
AG.&gt;AC : 26: RecipeRecommendation(recipes,\nrationale, toolCalls); off=AG
combinedFragment=loop~L AC CV; AG:[each recommended recipe]
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;CV : 27: validateRestrictions(recipe, profile); on=CV
CV.&gt;AC : 28: ValidationResult (allergens, diet, dislikes); off=CV
--=L
combinedFragment=alt~B GUI CV; F:[at least one recipe passes]
AC.&gt;F : 29: AgentResponse(SUCCESS,\nrecipes, rationale)
..=B; F:[nothing fits]
AC.&gt;F : 30: AgentResponse(CONFLICT,\nreasons); off=AC
F.&gt;GUI : 31: AgentResponse
GUI.&gt;U : 32: "Nothing in the recipe collection\nfits. Ask the AI to write one?"
U-&gt;&gt;&gt;GUI : 33: Yes
GUI-&gt;&gt;&gt;F : 34: generateRecipe(profileId,\nrequest, filters)
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;AC : 35: generateRecipe(request, query); on=AC
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;AG : 36: generateRecipe(context, query); on=AG
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;IR : 37: findAll(); on=IR
IR.&gt;AG : 38: catalogue ingredients (allowed\nones become the schema enum); off=IR
combinedFragment=loop~G AG LLM; TM:[attempt &lt;= 2 and the recipe still has problems]
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;PB : 39: buildRecipePrompt(context, query, previousProblems); on=PB
PB.&gt;AG : 40: prompt; off=PB
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;LLM : 41: generateStructured(prompt, generated_recipe schema, INSTRUCTIONS); on=LLM
LLM.&gt;AG : 42: recipe from catalogue ingredients only; off=LLM
--=G
