AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;CV : 44: validateRestrictions(recipe, profile); on=CV
CV.&gt;AC : 45: ValidationResult; off=CV
AC.&gt;F : 46: AgentResponse(NEEDS_CONFIRMATION,\nrecipe kept in pendingRecipes); off=AC
text=F:saveGeneratedRecipe(id)\nstores it only after the\nuser presses Save
--=B
